kanon 1

# O trecho que todo relatório do laboratório repete, escrito uma vez. É o caso que a
# D-005 previu: um fragmento traz o próprio contrato, e o hospedeiro não precisa saber
# quais campos ele exige — a carga unifica os dois.

data
  dataset       : text    !
  license       : text    = "CC BY 4.0"
  preregistered : boolean !

text

@@ availability
The data supporting this report are deposited at {dataset} and released under the {license} license. No result reported above depends on material that is not in that deposit.

@@ preregistration
The analysis plan was registered before collection began, and no outcome was added to it afterwards.

rules
  preregistration  when preregistered
